      "[len][type][payload]. 'csr' is the CSR the sample DER encoder (_ASW/_CSR/DER.c)",
      "builds for 'subject' and 'public_key' when SHA-1 returns 'ski_sha1' and the",
      "signer returns 'signature_raw' (r||s); that signature is a real ECDSA-SHA256",
      "signature over 'tbs' by the matching private key, so the Python tests can check",
      "that the device's CSR parses and verifies with the CA's library. Regenerate with",
      "_TEST/tools/gen_csr_vector.py (see _TEST/README.md) whenever DER.c changes."
    ],
